{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415760","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415760","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576001:1":{"text":"うわっ！嘘だろ……冬の戦乙女様じゃないですか！","source_cn":"赫托啊！我没看错，真的是冬喉女士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1149BFFC2A396885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576002:1":{"text":"アルナでよい。","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8057B3B962F34BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576003:0":{"text":"いやいや、そんな畏れ多い！あなたの伝説を知らないドワーフなんていないんですよ！","source_cn":"不不不，这样显得太不尊重您了！我们矮人都听过您的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC7DDBD45D1F8FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576004:0":{"text":"偉大なるセレスチアルの戦士。ひとりで魔物の包囲を突破し、フォルナガルドを救ったって……","source_cn":"一位伟大的半神战士，孤身一人突破了魔物的封锁，拯救了炉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x423BD36611C7AB43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576005:0":{"text":"ひとりではない。勇敢なドワーフの友人、ゲニッツも共に戦った。","source_cn":"我并不是一个人，还有位勇敢的矮人朋友，他叫格尼兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74B162967E7245D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576006:0":{"text":"そうそう！巨匠ゲニッツ！今でも一般的に使われている、武器鍛造の共通規範を作った方だ！","source_cn":"对！格尼兹大师！就是他制定了现在通用的武器锻造工艺规范！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CC8499A1F74D87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576007:0":{"text":"あなたと共に戦えたからこそ、武器にとって必要なものが何なのか理解できたんだってゲニッツ先生が言ってました。","source_cn":"他说过，正因曾经有幸与您并肩作战，他才会明白一把合格武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09F6AC0305F5CD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576008:0":{"text":"彼の不屈の精神が勝利を掴んだのだ。","source_cn":"他不屈的精神才是致胜的关键。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA544F8049353F0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576009:0":{"text":"それも、あなたから学んだんだって言ってました！","source_cn":"他也说过！这正是从您身上学到的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82B8D99FD8A5F54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576010:1":{"text":"それは過褒というものだ。我とゲニッツは互いに支え合い、あの戦いに勝利した。","source_cn":"谬赞了，孩子。是我们相互支撑，才打赢了那场战役。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44016C63D8EB9CA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576011:1":{"text":"ゲニッツと言えば、彼の孫は息災か？フォルナガルドには長いこと戻っていない……","source_cn":"说到格尼兹，他的孙子还好吗？我很久没有回炉卫城了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6903D09425A5C50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576012:1":{"text":"ヴォルフ先生ですか？オレ、あの人のもとで学んだことがあるんですよ。","source_cn":"您是说沃尔夫大师吗？我在他的手下当过一段时间学徒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA619F048FDBF397A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576013:1":{"text":"そいうか。ヴォルフもゲニッツと同じで、立派な赤い髭を生やしていたな。","source_cn":"嗯。他和格尼兹一样，都有着浓密的红色胡须。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AA18D21B81D08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576014:1":{"text":"えっと……オレがヴォルフ先生と知り合った時、先生の髭はもう真っ白でした。","source_cn":"呃，其实呢，我认识沃尔夫大师时，他已经是个白胡子老爷爷了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x213E2681BBB37E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576015:1":{"text":"……ふっ、時の流れか。","source_cn":"……呵，时间啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2C7B466758C2832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576016:1":{"text":"冬の戦乙女様、オレ何か間違ったこと言っちゃいました？","source_cn":"冬喉女士？我，我应该没有说错什么吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC69DCB38B5722AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576017:1":{"text":"言ったな。","source_cn":"有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B9FC159EAE9696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576018:1":{"text":"えっ！？","source_cn":"啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A673969906DD22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576019:1":{"text":"我のことは、アルナと呼べ。","source_cn":"叫我阿尔娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63A86532148E44B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576020:1":{"text":"……わ、分かりました、アルナ様！何かあったときはいつでも言ってください。オレもオルディン村のみんなも、喜んで力になりますから！","source_cn":"……好吧，阿尔娜女士！如果您有需要，我和深岩村都很乐意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BD85FC64FE5863D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"ゾーヤ","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔娜":{"text":"アルナ","source":"阿尔娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":2}}